        "quote": "the plaintiff appeals from an order of the Supreme Court, Rockland County (Rolf Thorsen, J.), dated August 8, 2017. The order granted the motion of the defendant Board of Managers at Vista at Kingsgate, Section II, for summary judgment dismissing the complaint insofar as asserted against it."
      },
